{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124880/extras/d4bd934906906697d3c6d0edaded4eca.poster.avif?t=1771944540\" width=1100 height=688 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124880/extras/d4bd934906906697d3c6d0edaded4eca.webm?t=1771944540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>Hidden Cats in Christmas</i>\u00a0brings our furry friends back to this special holiday!\u00a0 Relax in the Christmas World Park and enjoy traditional places. Each stage begins in shades of grey. As you find hidden kittens and characters, the world comes alive with color, revealing intricate details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique feline friends, discover special real cats shared by our community, and collect beautifully illustrated cards. Pairing certain special cats will even unlock new bonus stages to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for the challenge of finding every hidden object or just to relax with atmospheric art and music, <i>Hidden Cats in Christmas\u00a0</i>is a cozy hidden-object adventure for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 860 hidden objects to find!!! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the cats and paint the city.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look for special cats and unlock bonus levels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Christmas World Park.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect many cards and earn achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the radar to help search for cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sound FX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Level - Christmas World Park</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 cats to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Special Cats that unlock bonus levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 city people to help you earn radar hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124880/extras/c747d80aac61d873b6f24ddd7e05585f.poster.avif?t=1771944540\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124880/extras/c747d80aac61d873b6f24ddd7e05585f.webm?t=1771944540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>11 Bonus Levels</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas World Park: 212 kittens + 20 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Dinner: 50 kittens + 3 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowman Competition: 50 kittens + 3 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Food: 75 kittens + 5 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Tree: 100 kittens + 10 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorated House 100: kittens + 10 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decoration Store 100: kittens + 10 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Market 100: kittens + 20 characters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invert Mouse Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Drag Sensitivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge Screen Scrolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colo